<title>SAN MARINO: TENNIS-SAN MARINO MEN'S FINAL RESULT.</title>
<headline>TENNIS-SAN MARINO MEN'S FINAL RESULT.</headline>
<dateline>SAN MARINO 1997-08-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>Final result in the $300,000 San Marino men's clay-court tournament played on Sunday (Prefix number denotes seeding): 1-Felix Mantilla (Spain) beat Magnus Gustafsson (Sweden) 6-4 6-1</p>
</text>
